{{History of Balisca}}

'''New Volisania''', officially the '''Viceroyalty of New Volisana''', originally called the '''Kingdom of New Volisana''', was an integral territory of the [[Volisanian Empire]], established by the [[Crown of Volisana]], roughly corresponding to today's [[Northern Triangle]].  

